  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## What listeners single out\n\n- **Catch & Release** (1 other source): Played as a solo piece on acoustic guitar [1]\n- **Am I Born to Die?** (1 other source): Sung a cappella, and it is a cover of a Doc Watson Family song [1]\n\n## Setlist highlights\n\n- **If I Lose**: rare: 10 archived performances [4]\n- **Miss the Mississippi and You**: rare: 12 archived performances [4]\n- **Takin' a Slow Train**: rare: 10 archived performances [4]\n- **Tall Tall Grass**: back after 73 archived shows (385 days); rare: 6 archived performances [4]\n- **Howw Long Have I Been Waiting for You**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [4]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **billystrings2023-08-24.4017vl** (recommended): source not stated; 25 songs; 145 min; rated 0.5/5 by 2 [1]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **billystrings2023-08-24.4017vl**: taped by grawk; source: DPA 4018VL -> DPA mma:a d-vice [1]. Also: Checksums were generated with xACT 2.53 on 25 August 2023, the day after the show [1]\n\n## Art and photos\n\n- Poster by @BillybaseDotNet: [Billy Strings 2023-08-24 Knoxville Civic Coliseum Regular - BillyBase](https://billybase.net/merch/2023-08-24-knoxville-civic-coliseum-regular/) [5]\n- Fan art by @BillybaseDotNet: [Billy Strings 2023-08-24 Knoxville Civic Coliseum Regular - BillyBase](https://billybase.net/merch/2023-08-24-knoxville-civic-coliseum-regular/) [6]\n- Poster by @BillybaseDotNet: [Billy Strings Knoxville Civic Coliseum - Knoxville, TN - BillyBase](https://billybase.net/show/knoxville-civic-coliseum-knoxville-tn/) [7]",
